{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/6402919f4798b32f929bd17d476ecb09.avif?t=1770999044\" width=350 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A 2.5D Turn-Based Roguelike Skill Builder.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bEternity Breaker is a Turn-based Roguelike game with 2.5D pixel art fantasy graphics. The story is about the battle to find a way out of an endless dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/e96f7556af03b07445e729ab6dc0934e.poster.avif?t=1770999044\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/e96f7556af03b07445e729ab6dc0934e.webm?t=1770999044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/e96f7556af03b07445e729ab6dc0934e.mp4?t=1770999044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Eternity Breaker, combat requires the use of Skills. In each combat round, the Skills available for use are randomized, and skill upgrade statuses can also be randomized.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Example Skills in the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill types in the game are divided into 3 main categories:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/b5f73428e93a3db4222d884ee7631468.avif?t=1770999044\" width=650 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bMelee (Red), Magic (Blue), and Technical (Green). Each Skill type functions differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/0164e5e4308457c07dd9d92010fcb94a.poster.avif?t=1770999044\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/0164e5e4308457c07dd9d92010fcb94a.webm?t=1770999044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/0164e5e4308457c07dd9d92010fcb94a.mp4?t=1770999044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/7328ced1bca79d4716f0a18bac519801.poster.avif?t=1770999044\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/7328ced1bca79d4716f0a18bac519801.webm?t=1770999044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/7328ced1bca79d4716f0a18bac519801.mp4?t=1770999044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, the Skills you acquire in battle will also affect the main character's class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/9dea60c79b5c8542d63c54d3f371f945.poster.avif?t=1770999044\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/9dea60c79b5c8542d63c54d3f371f945.webm?t=1770999044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/9dea60c79b5c8542d63c54d3f371f945.mp4?t=1770999044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bClasses in this game are divided into 2 types:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u200bBasic Class:</strong> Has additional special techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Class:</strong> Has an additional ultimate attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/extras/ddffbd367e33c0b556f238e6991f9d67.avif?t=1770999044\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, if you acquire 2 Red-type Skills, you will change to the <strong>Warrior</strong> class. If you then get 2 Blue-type Skills, you will change to the <strong>Battle Mage</strong> class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bOr, if you get 4 Red-type Skills, you will change to the <strong>Black Knight</strong> class instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bThere are more than 20 classes available in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bAdditionally, combat also features Artifacts and items that allow you to combine various combat techniques, creating new and diverse playstyles in each run.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125860?t=1770999044","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125860?t=1770999044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/b45aaa307eaba1716da70404546ee19420781b03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770999044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125860/b45aaa307eaba1716da70404546ee19420781b03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770999044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28